   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi,<div><br></div><div>Just wanted to say thank you to all the great people at RStudio and especially those who have worked on Shiny!</div><div><br></div><div>I have just launched the website to SkyScorer (<a href=\"http://www.skyscorer.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.skyscorer.com&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792405369368000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0SZxhIlE1VIkcuAknWqhuH\">www.skyscorer.com</a>). It is one of the first commercialised Shiny based product that I know of.</div><div><br></div><div>Please sign-up to be an alpha tester if you are interested!</div><div><br></div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/-t3VniQaq4Rg/Uq0qO0OvyHI/AAAAAAAADi4/OuJklKjpK-U/s1600/skyscorer-website-dec2013.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/-t3VniQaq4Rg/Uq0qO0OvyHI/AAAAAAAADi4/OuJklKjpK-U/s1600/skyscorer-website-dec2013.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792405369368000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3pH3RUBvUjZM-U-vVZVaop\"><img src=\"https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/-t3VniQaq4Rg/Uq0qO0OvyHI/AAAAAAAADi4/OuJklKjpK-U/s400/skyscorer-website-dec2013.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"365\" height=\"400\"></a></p><div><br></div></div>"
